{{TABLE1}}

Table 1 lists the register. Of the {{papers}} papers, {{p_reproduces}} reproduce, {{p_fail}} fail, {{p_not_proven}} are not proven,
{{p_not_tested}} was not tested and {{p_withdrawn}} was withdrawn. The register holds {{claims}} claim rows
({{claims_tested}} tested): {{c_reproduces}} reproduce, {{c_fail}} fail, {{c_not_proven}} not proven, {{c_not_tested}}
not tested, {{c_withdrawn}} withdrawn. {{c_ours}} of the {{claims}} rows are our own baseline comparisons rather than
